.\" $FreeBSD$
.\" Man page for ocifbsd.conf
.\"
.Dd April 30, 2026
.Dt OCIFBSD.CONF 5
.Os FreeBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm ocifbsd.conf
.Nd configuration file for FreeBSD Native OCI Runtime
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the configuration file for the FreeBSD Native OCI Runtime
.Pq Nm ocifbsd .
The file format is that of
.Xr rc.conf 5 .
.Pp
The following variables can be set:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Va ocifbsd_enable
.Bd -literal
Type: boolean
Default: NO
Description: Set to YES to enable the ocifbsd daemon at boot.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_flags
.Bd -literal
Type: string
Default: (none)
Description: Additional flags to pass to the ocifbsd daemon.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_zfs_pool
.Bd -literal
Type: string
Default: zroot
Description: ZFS pool name for storing images, layers, and volumes.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_data_dir
.Bd -literal
Type: path
Default: /var/lib/ocifbsd
Description: Base directory for image and volume data.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_state_dir
.Bd -literal
Type: path
Default: /var/run/ocifbsd
Description: Directory for runtime state files.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_network_driver
.Bd -literal
Type: string
Default: bridge
Options: bridge, routed, overlay, host, none
Description: Default network driver for containers.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_bridge_name
.Bd -literal
Type: string
Default: ocifbsd0
Description: Bridge interface name for container networking.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_default_subnet
.Bd -literal
Type: CIDR
Default: 10.0.0.0/24
Description: Default subnet for container networks.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_default_gateway
.Bd -literal
Type: IP address
Default: 10.0.0.1
Description: Default gateway for container networks.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_default_registry
.Bd -literal
Type: string
Default: docker.io
Description: Default registry to pull images from.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_log_dir
.Bd -literal
Type: path
Default: /var/log/ocifbsd
Description: Directory for log files.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_log_level
.Bd -literal
Type: string
Default: info
Options: debug, info, warn, error
Description: Logging verbosity level.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_log_to_syslog
.Bd -literal
Type: boolean
Default: YES
Description: Send logs to syslog.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_default_memory_limit
.Bd -literal
Type: size
Default: 512M
Description: Default memory limit for containers.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_default_cpu_shares
.Bd -literal
Type: number
Default: 1024
Description: Default CPU shares (relative weight).
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_default_proc_limit
.Bd -literal
Type: number
Default: 1024
Description: Default maximum number of processes per container.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_default_security
.Bd -literal
Type: string
Default: default
Options: default, biba-low, biba-equal, mls-low, partition
Description: Default MAC security policy.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_default_network
.Bd -literal
Type: string
Default: bridge
Description: Default network mode for containers.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_default_dns
.Bd -literal
Type: IP address
Default: 8.8.8.8
Description: Default DNS server for containers.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_pull_timeout
.Bd -literal
Type: seconds
Default: 300
Description: Timeout for image pulls in seconds.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_cluster_enable
.Bd -literal
Type: boolean
Default: NO
Description: Enable clustering support.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_cluster_interface
.Bd -literal
Type: string
Default: vtnet0
Description: Network interface for cluster communication.
.Ed
.It Va ocifbsd_cluster_port
.Bd -literal
Type: number
Default: 2377
Description: Port for cluster control plane.
.Ed
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/ocifbsd/ocifbsd.conf
.It Pa /etc/ocifbsd/ocifbsd.conf
The configuration file.
.It Pa /var/run/ocifbsd/
Runtime state directory.
.It Pa /var/lib/ocifbsd/
Image and volume data directory.
.It Pa /var/log/ocifbsd/
Log directory.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ocifbsd 8 ,
.Xr jail 8 ,
.Xr rc.conf 5
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
file format first appeared in FreeBSD 15.0.
